# Local development uses the public settings already tracked in .env.
# Copy this file to .env.local only if local overrides are needed.
# .env.local is ignored by Git. Never add secret values to tracked files.
#
# This project uses Lovable Cloud. According to the project support response,
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, LOVABLE_API_KEY and connector MAPBOX_API_KEY
# are not available for supported local use. Do not attempt to extract them.
# Privileged server functions and gateway geocoding must be tested in Lovable.
# Keep the current backend and connectors. See LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT.md.
#
# Optional: override only when needed with the actual local app origin.
# APP_URL=http://localhost:8080
